DTSTART:20260910T120000Z
DTEND:20260910T130500Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:铁三基线测试：20分钟 FTP 自行车
DESCRIPTION:60 分钟总课程，执行 20 分钟硬阈值全力测试（实测 206 W，推算 FTP = 196 W / 2.54 W/kg，心率至 Zone 4.6）。
DTSTART:20260912T120000Z
DTEND:20260912T130000Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:铁三基线测试：5K 跑步与 CSS 游泳
DESCRIPTION:5K 全力计时跑（实测 24:23，均心 163 bpm）+ CSS 临界配速游泳测试（400yd 6:37 / 200yd 2:53，CSS = 1:52/100yd）。
DTSTART:20260913T120000Z
DTEND:20260913T132500Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mobility & Prehab
DESCRIPTION:30 min Zone 1 core & hip mobility
DTSTART:20260914T120000Z
DTEND:20260914T132500Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Swim & Run
DESCRIPTION:50 min CSS pace Swim (8 x 100 @1:50-1:52) + 45 min Zone 2 Run
DTSTART:20260915T120000Z
DTEND:20260915T132500Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bike & Strength
DESCRIPTION:75 min bike w/ 3x8m sweet spot @ 170-180w + 35 min strength
DTSTART:20260916T120000Z
DTEND:20260916T132500Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Swim & Run
DESCRIPTION:45 min aerobic ladder swim + 45 min zone 2 run w/ 6x25s strides
DTSTART:20260917T120000Z
DTEND:20260917T132500Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT

